  "notes": [
    "Advancement noun is 'promotion', care is 'medical care', cash is 'money', kin is 'family trouble', protection own is 'my safety': chosen so the nouns read in third-person reads.",
    "Reads use {own} after a colon ('Says only: my debt.') so the first person sits in quotation-like speech.",
    "Debrief lines avoid signal words; give-up widest case measured near 95 characters.",
    "The word debrief's {to} is read as the recipient (a name or role); the ladder 'to' is a scale step. Question for Motive: confirm they are the same field.",
    "Summons use only {other}; {other_noun} was not in the slot list so I left it out.",
    "The 'door' position noun is 'the door guard', per the Handover."
